"thenounproject.com/icon/recycling-5458016/) icon by Kosong Tujuh, [Excavator]"
"(https://thenounproject.com/icon/excavator-576937/) icon by Peter van Driel, "
"[Poison](https://thenounproject.com/icon/poison-3201818/) icon by Adrien "
"Coquet, all licensed under a [CC-BY](https://spdx.org/licenses/CC-BY-3.0."
"html) license. Design by Lana Lutz.)](images/sec1_e-waste-infographic.png)"
msgstr ""
"![El 2016 es van generar 44,7 milions de tones mètriques de residus "
