"`write.csv2(<DATAFRAME>, file = <PATH/TO/FILE.csv>, row.names = TRUE, quote "
"= FALSE)`"
msgstr ""
"`write.csv2(<DATAFRAME>, file = <PATH/TO/FILE.csv>, row.names = TRUE, quote "
