#: content/sustainable-goal/_index.md:0
msgid "Sustainable Software Goal"
msgstr "Objectiu de programari sostenible"

#: content/sustainable-goal/_index.md:9
msgid ""
"Software has an impact on our future. It has an affect on energy and "
"resource usage. KDE can deliver software which does this in a way which "
"preserves environment and society for us and future generations. KDE can "
"deliver Sustainable Software."
msgstr ""
"El programari té impacte en el nostre futur. Afecta l'ús d'energia i "
"recursos. La comunitat KDE pot proporcionar programari que ho faci de manera "
"que mantingui l'entorn i la societat per a nosaltres i les generacions "
"futures. La comunitat KDE pot lliurar programari sostenible."

#: content/sustainable-goal/_index.md:11
msgid ""
"The sustainable software goal is about promoting sustainability in KDE by "
"aligning existing activities, highlighting where our software is already "
"sustainably designed, stimulating actions to increase sustainability, and "
"creating standards/tools to quantify software sustainability."
msgstr ""
"L'objectiu de programari sostenible és promoure la sostenibilitat a KDE "
"alineant les activitats existents, destacant on el nostre programari ja està "
"dissenyat de manera sostenible, estimulant accions per a augmentar la "
"sostenibilitat i creant estàndards/eines per a quantificar la sostenibilitat "
"del programari."

#. home.header-subtitle
#: i18n/en.yaml:4
msgid ""
"Independent, energy-efficient Free & Open Source Software for long-term "
"hardware use."
msgstr ""
"Programari lliure de codi obert independent i eficient energèticament per a "
"l'ús de maquinari a llarg termini."

#. home.sustainability-title
#: i18n/en.yaml:6
msgid "Be Green (End User)"
msgstr "Sigueu verds (usuari final)"

#. home.sustainability-description
#: i18n/en.yaml:8
msgid ""
"Opt in to lower energy demands, extended hardware life, device independence, "
"and user control for a healthier digital society."
msgstr ""
"Opteu a reduir la demanda energètica, prolongar la vida útil del maquinari, "
"la independència del dispositiu i el control de l'usuari per a una societat "
"digital més saludable."

#. home.advocate-title
#: i18n/en.yaml:10
msgid "Grow Green (Advocate)"
msgstr "Creixement verd (defensa)"

#. home.advocate-description
#: i18n/en.yaml:12
msgid ""
"Build communities and user support networks to bring the benefits of "
"independent, sustainable software to your hometown."
msgstr ""
"Construïu comunitats i xarxes de suport als usuaris per a aportar els "
"beneficis d'un programari independent i sostenible a la vostra ciutat natal."

#. home.impact-title
#: i18n/en.yaml:14
msgid "Make Green (Dev)"
msgstr "Creeu verd (desenvolupament)"

#. home.impact-description
#: i18n/en.yaml:16
msgid ""
"Develop applications and software features with a focus on efficiency and "
"sustainability for this and future generations."
msgstr ""
"Desenvolupeu aplicacions i funcionalitats de programari amb un enfocament en "
"l'eficiència i la sostenibilitat per a aquesta generació i les futures."

#. home.about-foss-title
#: i18n/en.yaml:18
msgid "What makes FOSS sustainable?"
msgstr "Què fa que el FOSS sigui sostenible?"

#. home.featured-blog-posts-title
#: i18n/en.yaml:20
msgid "Featured blog posts"
msgstr "Articles destacats del blog"

#. home.events-title
#: i18n/en.yaml:22
msgid "Events"
msgstr "Esdeveniments"

#. home.about-foss-description
#: i18n/en.yaml:24
msgid ""
"Free & Open Source Software (FOSS) guarantees transparency and user "
"autonomy, by design. These are not features, but inherent qualities to open "
"development and software licensing. As a result, software and hardware are "
"no longer dependent on vendors for support."
msgstr ""
"El programari lliure i de codi obert (FOSS) garanteix la transparència i "
"l'autonomia dels usuaris, per disseny. No són característiques, sinó "
"qualitats inherents al desenvolupament obert i la llicència de programari. "
"Com a resultat, el programari i el maquinari ja no depenen dels proveïdors "
"per al suport."

#. home.about-foss-description-2
#: i18n/en.yaml:26
msgid ""
"FOSS can be studied and improved independently, including in its energy "
"consumption. Premature hardware obsolescence is a thing of the past. FOSS "
"runs on devices that are decades old. Keep your computer in use to the end "
"of the hardware operating life, not the software."
msgstr ""
"El FOSS es pot estudiar i millorar de manera independent, fins i tot en el "
"seu consum energètic. L'obsolescència prematura del maquinari és cosa del "
"passat. El FOSS funciona amb dispositius que tenen dècades d'antiguitat. "
"Mantingueu l'ordinador en ús fins al final de la vida útil del maquinari, no "
"del programari."

#. home.about-kde-title
#: i18n/en.yaml:28
msgid "About KDE and KDE Eco"
msgstr "Quant a KDE i KDE Eco"

#. home.about-kde-description-kde
#: i18n/en.yaml:30
msgid ""
"KDE is a world-wide community of software engineers, artists, writers, "
"translators, and creators who are committed to Free Software development. We "
"are a cooperative enterprise: we work together to achieve the common goal of "
"building the world's finest Free & Open Source Software. Everyone is welcome "
"to join and contribute to KDE, including you."
msgstr ""
"KDE és una comunitat mundial d'enginyers de programari, artistes, "
"escriptors, traductors i creadors que estan compromesos amb el "
"desenvolupament de programari lliure. Som una empresa cooperativa: treballem "
"junts per a aconseguir l'objectiu comú de construir el millor programari "
"lliure i de codi obert del món. Tothom hi és benvingut a unir-se i "
"contribuir a KDE, incloent-vos-hi."

#. home.about-kde-description-kde-2
#: i18n/en.yaml:32
msgid ""
"Supported by the KDE community since 2021, KDE Eco has the ongoing mission "
"of the development and adoption of sustainable Free & Open Source Software "
"worldwide. As the ecological impact of digitization grows more relevant, we "
"continue to raise awareness about the role of software design in reducing "
"environmental harm. We are proudly a part of a growing number of communities "
"and organizations working to have a positive ecological impact, today."
msgstr ""
"Amb el suport de la comunitat KDE des de 2021, KDE Eco té la missió en curs "
"de desenvolupar i adoptar el programari lliure i de codi obert sostenible a "
"tot el món. A mesura que l'impacte ecològic de la digitalització creix més, "
"seguim conscienciant sobre el paper del disseny de programari en la reducció "
"del dany ambiental. Estem orgullosos de formar part d'un nombre creixent de "
"comunitats i organitzacions que treballen per tenir un impacte ecològic "
"positiu, avui dia."

#. home.header.sustainable-goal.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:34
msgid ""
"Software has a direct affect on energy and resource consumption. Since 2022, "
"KDE has the goal of providing software which does this in a way that reduces "
"software’s environmental impact for us and future generations."
msgstr ""
"El programari té un efecte directe en el consum d'energia i recursos. Des de "
"2022, KDE té l'objectiu de proporcionar programari que ho faci de manera que "
"redueixi l'impacte ambiental del programari per a nosaltres i per a les "
"generacions futures."

#. home.header.feep.subtitle
#: i18n/en.yaml:36
msgid "Free and open source software Energy Efficiency Project"
msgstr "Projecte d'eficiència energètica de programari de codi lliure i obert"

#. home.header.feep.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:38
msgid ""
"How can you measure software’s energy consumption? And does it make a "
"difference? We are working to make free software more sustainable."
msgstr ""
"Com es pot mesurar el consum d'energia del programari? I això marca una "
"diferència? Estem treballant per a fer més sostenible el programari lliure."

#. home.header.be4foss.subtitle
#: i18n/en.yaml:40
msgid "Blauer Engel for Free and Open Source Software"
msgstr "Blauer Engel per a programari de codi lliure i obert"

#. home.header.be4foss.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:42
msgid ""
"Eco-labels for products are used widely already. But how can they be "
"transferred to software? What criteria is relevant? We need more pioneers to "
"find out how we can make software sustainable."
msgstr ""
"Les ecoetiquetes ja s'empren àmpliament per als productes. Però, com es "
"poden transferir al programari? Quins criteris són importants? Necessitem "
"més pioners per a esbrinar com podem fer programari sostenible."

#. home.header.more
#: i18n/en.yaml:44 i18n/en.yaml:149 i18n/en.yaml:175
msgid "Learn More"
msgstr "Apreneu-ne més"

#. home.eco-handbook
#: i18n/en.yaml:46
msgid "KDE Eco Handbook"
msgstr "Manual del KDE Eco"

#. home.about-website
#: i18n/en.yaml:48
msgid "About This Website"
msgstr "Sobre aquest lloc web"

#. home.about-website-description
#: i18n/en.yaml:50
msgid ""
"This website is open-source. Source code and asset licenses can be found in "
"the [KDE Eco Repository](https://invent.kde.org/websites/eco-kde-org). This "
"website was checked by the [greenwebfoundation.org](https://www."
"thegreenwebfoundation.org/green-web-check/?url=https%3A%2F%2Feco.kde.org) "
"and is labelled \"Hosted Green\". Website is hosted by: Hetzner Online AG. "
"Supporting evidence for this hoster’s claims: [Sustainability Page](https://"
"www.hetzner.com/unternehmen/umweltschutz)."
msgstr ""
"Aquest lloc web és de codi obert. Les llicències del codi font i dels "
"recursos es poden trobar al [repositori KDE Eco](https://invent.kde.org/"
"websites/eco-kde-org). Aquest lloc web ha estat verificat per la "
"[greenwebfoundation.org](https://www.thegreenwebfoundation.org/green-web-"
"check/?url=https%3A%2F%2Feco.kde.org) i està etiquetat com a «Hosted Green». "
"El lloc web està allotjat per: Hetzner Online AG. Proves de confirmació de "
"les afirmacions d'aquest proveïdor: [Pàgina de sostenibilitat](https://www."
"hetzner.com/unternehmen/umweltschutz)."

#. home.eco-handbook.alt
#: i18n/en.yaml:52
msgid "Plots of real time measurements using KDE’s LabPlot."
msgstr "Diagrames de mesures en temps real usant el LabPlot de KDE."

#. home.okular
#: i18n/en.yaml:54
msgid "Okular Awarded Blue Angel Ecolabel"
msgstr "L'Okular ha rebut l'ecoetiqueta Blue Angel"

#. home.okular.be
#: i18n/en.yaml:56
msgid ""
"In 2022, KDE’s popular multi-platform PDF reader and universal document "
"viewer Okular became the first ever eco-certified computer program!"
msgstr ""
"El 2022, el popular lector de PDF i visualitzador universal de documents "
"multiplataforma de KDE, l'Okular, ha esdevingut el primer programa "
"d'ordinador eco-certificat!"

